{
  "label": "day144",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label day144:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene roofday",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/BGs/roofday.png",
      "alt": "roofday"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I somehow find myself on the rooftop yet again.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I don’t have anything particular in mind and I’m not really looking for Makoto or Yumi or anyone but...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I don’t know, I guess I kind of just wound up here without putting much thought into it.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I’m becoming one step closer to the lead in an anime every day.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Ami is going to be so proud.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I begin to pace around the perimeter of the rooftop, trying to figure out whether I’m alone up here or not, but then spot something a little...out of the ordinary.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyointro1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyointro1.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyointro1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "???",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "For a brief moment in time, I forget that I’m a teacher and worry about her getting scared of me or something along those lines.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But judging by her stone faced reaction to my blazer and...well the fact that I’m on the roof of the[school], I’m pretty sure she’s able to figure it out.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "???",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The two of us sort of just...stand there staring at each other for, well, an uncomfortably long amount of time.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "How should I handle this?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "menu:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Keep staring",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "???",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "No reaction...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "menu:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Keep staring...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyointro2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyointro2.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyointro2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...?",
      "spk": "???",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "What the hell is up with this girl?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "menu:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "KEEP STARING!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyointro3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyointro3.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyointro3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...!",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "???",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...!!!!!!!!",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ....????",
      "spk": "???",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "menu:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Omfg",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Jesus Christ, are you really going to just keep staring at me? What’s your deal?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "???",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyointro4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyointro4.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyointro4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "???",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And now she’s looking away from me?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "What even happened? All I did was stare at her.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Okay, well, it sounds a little bad when I actually repeat it back to myself, but still.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I’ve done much worse to different people and at least gotten reactions out of them.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "This is torture.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "jump hellotsuneyo2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Say hello",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "jump hellotsuneyo",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Say hello",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "jump hellotsuneyo",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Say hello",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "jump hellotsuneyo",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Say hello",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "jump hellotsuneyo",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label hellotsuneyo:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey. What are you up to?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "???",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyointro4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyointro4.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyointro4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "???",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Is she...ignoring me?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "What the hell did I do wrong?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "jump hellotsuneyo2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label hellotsuneyo2:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Can you at least tell me your name? That would be a good place to start.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "???",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ramen.",
      "spk": "Ramen?...",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Your name is Ramen?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyointro5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyointro5.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyointro5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...Mm.",
      "spk": "Ramen?...",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The girl closes her eyes and simply nods. I refuse to believe her name is Ramen.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It would be one thing to come out and say she doesn’t want to talk to me, but to lie just seconds after meeting? That’s unforgivable.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You know I’m a teacher, right? I can give you detention.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Ramen?...",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is that something you want? Detention? It’s not fun. I can promise you that.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Ramen?...",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "You know...maybe I should just head back downstairs.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I can tell this meeting isn’t going anywhere and-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You came to the ramen shop with a girl before.",
      "spk": "Ramen?...",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ramen shop?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyointro6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyointro6.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyointro6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Tojo Ramen. My family's restaurant. Old District. Thirteen minutes by bus.",
      "spk": "Ramen?...",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Thirteen minutes by bus?...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Wait, is she talking about the second half of town?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I vaguely remember going to a ramen shop there with Yumi but...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait a minute, you were the girl behind the counter, weren’t you?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Tsuneyo.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Tsuneyo Tojo? That’s your full name?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Correct.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That sounds like a samurai name.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Samurai of flavor.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyointro7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyointro7.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyointro7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m so sorry.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Thank you for apologizing. That was one of the worst jokes I’ve ever heard.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Comedy isn’t really my strong suit.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No, it’s really not...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But on the bright side, whatever dish you made me that night at the restaurant was great.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m not normally one to rave about ramen, but I can definitely see myself coming back for that sometime soon.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyointro8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyointro8.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyointro8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Thank you.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I plan to take over once my father passes, so I am eternally grateful to hear that.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Eternally grateful?...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Why is she being so formal with me?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You know you can talk a little more casually, Tsuneyo.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyointro9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyointro9.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyointro9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ah-",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Oh, shit. I’ve gotten so used to calling the other girls by their first names that I’ve forgotten that isn’t really what most people are accustomed to.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I guess Tsuneyo’s family is a little more traditional in nature. I’m honestly not surprised with a name as heavy as ‘Tojo.’",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m not used to talking informally. I might make a mistake.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What kind of mistake would you even make with something like that?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Who knows, bro?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Did you just call me bro?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyointro7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyointro7.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyointro7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": See what I mean?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, I get it. You can just stick to your normal way of speaking for now.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you okay with me using your first name, though?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyointro6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyointro6.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyointro6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sure. A name is a name. It doesn’t make much difference to me.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Cool. So, Tsuneyo-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyointro9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyointro9.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyointro9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ah-",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...You’re not actually going to have an easy time adjusting to that, are you?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyointro10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyointro10.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyointro10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No. It appears I am not.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, anyway, would you mind explaining what you’re doing on the roof?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You know students aren’t supposed to be up here, right?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyointro8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyointro8.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyointro8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We’re not?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Nope. It’s grounds for immediate expulsion or something like that.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That sounds serious.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You say that, but you haven’t moved an inch.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyointro6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyointro6.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyointro6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you going to discipline me, Sensei?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I really wish she wouldn’t say things like that out of nowhere.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I’m suddenly blindsided by an onslaught of malicious thoughts that I need to fight off in order to carry on the conversation.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Discipline isn't really my style. I’m more or less curious about how you made it onto the roof.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The same way you did.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyointro10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyointro10.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyointro10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": One step at a time...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re not trying to sound philosophical, are you? Because if so, that was pretty bad.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyointro11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyointro11.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyointro11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Philosophy isn’t a strong suit of mine either.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I can tell. But hey, at least you have cooking.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyointro5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyointro5.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyointro5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s right.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I will spend the rest of my life washing pork broth out of my hair.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It is not a glamorous life, but it is one that I have accepted.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Huh...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I wonder if this is one of those “I was born into my role and didn’t get to choose it” scenarios that typically arise as plot devices in TV and whatnot.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey, Tsuneyo.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyointro9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyointro9.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyointro9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ah-",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How do you feel about taking over for your father?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyointro3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyointro3.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyointro3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I am fine with it.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I can not become a stand-up comedian, so this is the only choice I have.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So your only options in life are ramen and stand-up comedy?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No. Just ramen. Comedy is off the table.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well if you ever want to expand your horizons or anything, my office is always open.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Now, I know what you’re thinking.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Me? Offering up an actual counseling session to a [teenage]girl without any ulterior motives?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And to that I say-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Of course I have ulterior motives.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I pretty much always have ulterior motives.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But at least Tsuneyo is...entertaining to talk to if not anything else.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Your office?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah. You...do realize I’m a teacher here, right?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I did not initially, no.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So...you thought I was just some random guy on the roof asking you about your future?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is that not common at this[school]?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Aren’t we like, halfway through the[school] year? You should know what is and isn’t common by now.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyointro4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyointro4.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyointro4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I have only been coming here for several weeks.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m afraid I don’t know what is or isn’t normal yet.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But if you are willing to explain things to me, I will graciously accept your assistance.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait, you’ve only been coming here for a few weeks? Why?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyointro6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyointro6.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyointro6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I was homeschooled until recently.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But my father has become sick and now I must rely on Ms. Watabe.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ms. Watabe? So you know Molly?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyointro9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyointro9.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyointro9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Molly?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah. She just transferred to my class from Ms. Watabe’s.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Irish girl. Red hair. Blue eyes. Hyper.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyointro12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyointro12.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyointro12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Her...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s a strange reaction, but I’m pretty sure it's warranted.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I was under the impression her name was...umm...what was it? Emerald Guardian of the Crystal Forest?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s her full name. We call her Molly for short.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyointro9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyointro9.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyointro9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh. Well then perhaps I wasn’t deceived after all.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Is Tsuneyo really this gullible?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Just how sheltered is she?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you have any friends that you hang out with outside of[school], Tsuneyo? I can’t imagine it’s easy making them while being homeschooled.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyointro5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyointro5.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyointro5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I have no friends. Just noodles.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I can’t help but bust out into laughter at Tsuneyo’s noodle comment and spend the next several seconds trying to regain my composure...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Actually, Tsuneyo...Maybe there is hope for you in comedy after all.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyointro8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyointro8.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyointro8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Really? What made you change your mind?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The noodle joke was actually pretty great. Self-deprecating humor is hard to get right, but I think you hit the nail on the head.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Noodle joke?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah. No friends, just noodles.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyointro7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyointro7.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyointro7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That wasn’t a joke...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait, is your life really that sad?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There’s nothing sad about noodles.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "This poor girl.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ll be your friend, Tsuneyo. That way you won’t need to feel-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyointro13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyointro13.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyointro13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No thank you.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t think you heard me correctly. All I was doing was offering to be your friend. I wasn’t asking you on a date.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, I see.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So, does that mean we can-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No thank you.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Mind if I ask why?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyointro4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyointro4.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyointro4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t exactly know the reason.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I just know that my father has forbidden me from associating with any male figure that has not received his blessing.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But we’ve been associating for the entire lunch period.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Tsuneyo pauses (Which is to be expected at this point) and thinks for a moment before letting out a light sigh and causing her shoulders to droop.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think this much is fine.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If he asks what I did today, I can just tell him I ran into a customer.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you report everything you do to your father?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyointro13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyointro13.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyointro13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Of course. Is that not normal?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Not really by modern standards, no. But I guess it’s different from family to family.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I see.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you have any children?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I have a [niece]. I guess she’s kind of like a daughter at times, though.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You might have seen her around, actually. Her name is Ami. I’m pretty sure she has the longest twintails in the[school].",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Twintails? Are they red?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah. So you do know her then?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes. She complimented me on my skin.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No one has ever “flirted” with me before, so it stood out in my mind.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sorry to break the news to you, but that’s not exactly what flirting is.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyointro9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyointro9.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyointro9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s not? But she gave me a compliment based on my appearance.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I already wrote her a rejection letter and everything.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, I think it might be best to just hang onto that for now.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
